graph TD
    classDef trigger fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef logic fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef db fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px;

    Event[Task Marked 'DONE']:::trigger --> Rule{Are all Sub-tasks DONE?}:::logic
    
    Rule -->|No| Revert[System Actor: Revert Status to TODO]:::logic
    Rule -->|Yes| OK[Allow State Change]:::logic
    
    Revert --> Log[Record Correlation ID]:::db
    Revert --> UI[Emit SSE: Rule Violation Notification]:::db
